# ppc overrides - emitted after the profile's fragments, so this can take
# back what a shared fragment turned on. See generate-config.sh.

# Java and .NET. runtimes.config asks for both, and Kconfig still offers
# them on 32-bit PowerPC: OpenJDK falls back to its zero (interpreter-only)
# VM, and mono to its ppc32 port. Neither has been built big-endian here,
# and each adds hours to a from-source build whose first job is to prove
# the Swift runtime and the image. They are withdrawn until they are built
# and run on this target, rather than left to fail somewhere in the build.
#
# BR2_PACKAGE_OPENJDK is not set
# BR2_PACKAGE_MONO is not set
